[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 2: Use the distance = speed × time formula
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s denote the time spent walking (excluding coffee shop) as $ T $ hours.
