[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 3: Set up equations from the given times
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m #### Case 1: $ s $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
