[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - The **inradius** $ r = 6 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - The **area** $ \Delta $ of triangle $ ABC $ is related to $ r $ and $ s $, where $ s = \frac{a + b + c}{2} $ is the semi-perimeter:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m   $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m   \Delta = r \cdot s = 6s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m   $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
