[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m IA = \sqrt{r^2 + (s - a)^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m \Rightarrow 2\sqrt{39} = \sqrt{6^2 + (s - a)^2}
