[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m s = \frac{-2 \pm 7}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ s = \frac{5}{2} = 2.5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ s = \frac{-9}{2} = -4.5 $ (discard negative speed)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
