[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m and a **rhombus** $ABCD$ inscribed in this hyperbola, with **diagonals intersecting at the origin**.
