[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So, for point $A = (-a, b)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \tag{1}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Similarly, for point $B = (c, d)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
