[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s compute $BD^2$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $B = (c, d)$, $D = (-c, -d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - So, $BD^2 = (-c - c)^2 + (-d - d)^2 = (-2c)^2 + (-2d)^2 = 4c^2 + 4d^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2) \tag{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 4: Use the hyperbola equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
