[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m \frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1 \tag{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s solve for $a^2$ and $c^2$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m From (1): $a^2 = 20\left(1 + \frac{b^2}{24}\right) = 20 + \frac{20b^2}{24} = 20 + \frac{5b^2}{6}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m From (2): $c^2 = 20\left(1 + \frac{d^2}{24}\right) = 20 + \frac{5d^2}{6}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD^2 = 4\left( c^2 + d^2 \right) = 4\left( 20 + \frac{5d^2}{6} + d^2 \right) = 4\left(20 + \frac{11d^2}{6} \right)
