[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD^2 = 4 \cdot \left(20 + \frac{11d^2}{6} \right) = 80 + \frac{44d^2}{6} = 80 + \frac{22d^2}{3}
