[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 4: Let’s define variables more carefully
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s define:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - Distance = 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - Time at speed $ s $: $ T_1 = 4 $ hours (including $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop)
