[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ T_2 = 2.4 $ hours (including $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So the **time spent walking** is $ 4 - \frac{t}{60} $ hours at speed $ s $, and $ 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} $ hours at speed $ s + 2 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 5: Write equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
