[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 6: Solve the system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ t = 60x $, where $ x $ is in hours (so that $ t $ is in minutes)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ t = 60x $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ \frac{t}{60} = x $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So the equations become:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
