[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 7: Solve equation (1) for $ s $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m s = \frac{9}{4 - x}
