[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Divide by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 5x^2 - 32x + 12 = 0
