[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 8: Solve the quadratic
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Use the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
