[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ x = 0.4 $, so $ t = 60x = 24 $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m - $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
