[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Compute the difference:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m \frac{9(s + 2) - 9s}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6
