[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let $\triangle ABC$ have circumcenter $O$ and incenter $I$ with $\overline{IA}\perp\overline{OI}$, circumradius $13$, and inradius $6$. Find $AB\cdot AC$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Please reason step by step. Write your final answer on the last line in the format "Answer: <integer>", using a plain integer without leading zeros.
