[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 3: Use the rhombus properties
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m In a rhombus, all sides are equal in length. So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m AB = BC = CD = DA
