[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m But we can use the fact that the diagonals are perpendicular and bisect each other.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m The diagonals are $AC$ and $BD$, with lengths:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
