[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m We also have from (3):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m bd = -ac \tag{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Let’s try to express everything in terms of $a$ and $c$ (or $b$ and $d$), and find the expression for $BD^2$.
