[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 5: Compute $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m The diagonal $BD$ goes from $(c, d)$ to $(-c, -d)$, so its length is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD = \sqrt{(-c - c)^2 + (-d - d)^2} = \sqrt{(-2c)^2 + (-2d)^2} = \sqrt{4c^2 + 4d^2} = 2\sqrt{c^2 + d^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD^2 = 4(c^2 + d^2) \tag{4}
