[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 6: Express $c^2 + d^2$ in Terms of $a$ and $c$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m From (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m \frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow \frac{c^2}{20} - 1 = \frac{d^2}{24} \Rightarrow d^2 = \frac{24}{20}c^2 - 24 = \frac{6}{5}c^2 - 24 \tag{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m c^2 + d^2 = c^2 + \left(\frac{6}{5}c^2 - 24\right) = \frac{11}{5}c^2 - 24 \tag{6}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m Now plug into (4):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m BD^2 = 4 \left( \frac{11}{5}c^2 - 24 \right) = \frac{44}{5}c^2 - 96 \tag{7}
