[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m ### Step 4: Use the inradius formula
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m We know the inradius $r = 6$, and the area $A$ of the triangle can be expressed in terms of the inradius and semiperimeter:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13888)[0m $$
